{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Placing no more than one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> in each small square, what is the greatest number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />'s that can be put on the grid shown without getting three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />'s in a row vertically, horizontally, or diagonally?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c0904a1807339bc66742fe6716ebc810957bf718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/6/576db4a62e5962b96cea1f116caeaf042480f7b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for(int a=0; a&lt;4; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,3));  } for(int b=0; b&lt;4; ++b)  {   draw((0,b)--(3,b));  }  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is impossible to place <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or more X's, as there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or fewer empty squares and thus not every row could have an empty square.\n</p><p>It is possible to place <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f2192779fb1d8828b06ce59a7ae3f9a2ef90ca5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" /> X's as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/0831669d352a9bb7eaa40e88f39889266539fae7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for(int a=0; a&lt;4; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,3));  } for(int b=0; b&lt;4; ++b)  {   draw((0,b)--(3,b));  } label(&quot;X&quot;, (0.5, 0.5)); label(&quot;X&quot;, (0.5, 1.5)); label(&quot;X&quot;, (1.5, 0.5)); label(&quot;X&quot;, (1.5, 2.5)); label(&quot;X&quot;, (2.5, 1.5)); label(&quot;X&quot;, (2.5, 2.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" titl